WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:02.516 --> 00:00:04.969
I was so much stressed 
by my lower back pain.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.342
It was really very severe.

00:00:06.441 --> 00:00:08.838
Insurance companies have 
their own tantrums, here it was,Tata AIG.

00:00:08.966 --> 00:00:10.362
It was a totally bad experience.

00:00:11.079 --> 00:00:13.800
The taxi drivers were pouncing on me.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.092
They were like, "Come to me, come to me."

00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:18.600
Thank God, 
they were not after my luggage.

00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:22.500
Anyways, I had to leave 
without any treatment.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.967
Tat AIG, I request you
to kindly look into the matter.

00:00:25.096 --> 00:00:29.600
I had faced such a situation in Oman,
in the month of December.

00:00:29.846 --> 00:00:31.164
Now, again in Europe.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:32.799
That is, in January 2022.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.167
Mr. Farhan is accompanying me 
to a place

00:00:43.263 --> 00:00:46.500
from where I can take
a bus or taxi to Muscat.

00:00:46.689 --> 00:00:50.379
I am paying 4 Rial to go to Muscat
in this taxi.

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:53.967
ACs have been installed in taxi stands.

00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:58.633
I have covered my head with a 
handkerchief, means, I am in a gurudwara.

00:01:00.236 --> 00:01:03.567
Today was a very bad day for me.

00:01:03.889 --> 00:01:05.873
I am so upset.

00:01:06.081 --> 00:01:07.702
My day started at about 2 a.m.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:09.952
I was so much stressed 
by my lower back pain.

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:11.119
It was really very severe.

00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.792
I was in a gurudwara in Ghala.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.800
Waited till morning hoping to feel better.

00:01:15.902 --> 00:01:16.942
But it got worse.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.367
At about 6, I was like, 
started 'bothering' the people around me.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.014
There was a gentleman in the gurudwara.
I messaged him.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.667
Some people helped me out
and I reached the hospital emergency unit.

00:01:25.761 --> 00:01:28.349
I got myself admitted for some time.

00:01:28.805 --> 00:01:32.204
And then 
I started calling my insurance company.

00:01:32.276 --> 00:01:34.500
Inquired whether it would be 
covered or not.

00:01:34.659 --> 00:01:37.067
Insurance companies have 
their own tantrums, here it was, Tata AIG.

00:01:37.257 --> 00:01:38.638
It was a totally bad experience.

00:01:39.024 --> 00:01:41.500
Why my experience with Tata AIG
turned to be bad,

00:01:41.714 --> 00:01:44.733
I had forgotten to mention that
in my previous video recording.

00:01:44.997 --> 00:01:46.608
So now, I'm narrating it.

00:01:46.743 --> 00:01:49.067
My pain was really very severe 
the other night.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:52.333
First of all, I called 
my insurance company to get the details

00:01:52.591 --> 00:01:54.511
of their designated 
tie-up hospitals in Oman,

00:01:54.687 --> 00:01:56.734
where I could avail cashless treatment.

00:01:56.857 --> 00:02:00.574
I wanted to undergo a proper treatment

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:04.233
so that my onward journey 
to other countries

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.445
would be stress-free 
and I would be relieved of my pain.

00:02:06.614 --> 00:02:09.033
So, my intention was 
to get proper treatment.

00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:11.800
They were like, 
"You can go to any hospital,

00:02:12.001 --> 00:02:14.653
and talk to the concerned doctor.

00:02:14.749 --> 00:02:17.500
After that, send the bills to us.

00:02:17.727 --> 00:02:20.191
We will approve whatever we feel right."

00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:23.500
It was very clear from 
what they said, that

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:27.300
there were good chances
of non-approval of many of my bills.

00:02:27.374 --> 00:02:30.400
We all know how expensive it is
to undergo treatment in a foreign land.

00:02:30.527 --> 00:02:32.276
I didn't want to fall prey
to such a situation here.

00:02:32.514 --> 00:02:37.598
So, I asked them to provide me the 
list of their empaneled hospitals where

00:02:37.701 --> 00:02:42.245
I could avail myself the required treatment,
the required diagnosis, and,

00:02:42.325 --> 00:02:43.368
they would be 
in the form of cashless treatment.

00:02:43.433 --> 00:02:45.987
That's the purpose of opting
for a travel insurance.

00:02:46.154 --> 00:02:47.846
But, here, it was something else.

00:02:48.372 --> 00:02:49.554
And the most important thing,

00:02:49.705 --> 00:02:52.486
I was talking 
to a third party over the phone.

00:02:52.629 --> 00:02:55.537
Tata AIG sold its insurance policy to me.

00:02:55.609 --> 00:02:58.412
And now, if you have to discuss anything
regarding claim or such issues,

00:02:58.507 --> 00:03:00.633
you have to call this third party.

00:03:00.879 --> 00:03:02.704
It was not easy to talk to these people.

00:03:02.831 --> 00:03:06.300
Call drops were frequent. I was calling 
India from a foreign country.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:07.876
We all know how expensive these calls are.

00:03:08.138 --> 00:03:10.408
And then, calls were getting disconnected.

00:03:10.522 --> 00:03:12.244
Conversations could not be completed.

00:03:12.494 --> 00:03:16.000
And even when I could speak continuously,
they had their own typical answer,

00:03:16.219 --> 00:03:20.300
"We will be able to respond
only when you send us the bills."

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.050
The experience at the hospital 
turned out to be bad too.

00:03:23.781 --> 00:03:26.260
The hospital authorities don't want 
to deal with the insurance companies.

00:03:26.363 --> 00:03:28.867
They were insisting on getting the 
entire money deposited in their hospital.

00:03:28.946 --> 00:03:30.812
They were not satisfied with the 
guarantee of the insurance companies.

00:03:31.034 --> 00:03:34.474
They were like, they have to keep pinging
for money for about 6 months or so.

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:37.433
And so they preferred 
to deal with everything in cash.

00:03:37.678 --> 00:03:42.433
Travelers like me 
buy insurance policies because

00:03:42.763 --> 00:03:47.467
God forbid if they land into 
such unforeseen circumstances,

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:50.600
they are not forced to lose more money.

00:03:50.779 --> 00:03:54.333
But in this hospital, whose name was
NMC or something like that...

00:03:54.472 --> 00:03:56.172
It was totally a bad experience.

00:03:56.522 --> 00:03:58.667
I met all concerned people,
I met the head of the marketing team.

00:03:58.796 --> 00:04:04.400
They were just 
shirking off their responsibilities.

00:04:04.961 --> 00:04:09.633
They were so casual, they said, 
"Our money gets blocked."

00:04:09.888 --> 00:04:12.567
"We are not linked to the companies."

00:04:12.636 --> 00:04:16.200
I then said, "If that is so,
you can always go for a pre-approval."

00:04:16.927 --> 00:04:19.953
"And when they are promising to pay, why 
do you refrain from cashless treatment?"

00:04:20.067 --> 00:04:23.368
They were like, "They promise but then,

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:25.981
we have to run for 6 months behind them
to get our money."

00:04:26.061 --> 00:04:28.061
And so, we prefer cash only.

00:04:28.279 --> 00:04:31.767
Anyways, I had to leave 
without any treatment.

00:04:32.539 --> 00:04:35.067
My lower backache problem
started troubling me again.

00:04:35.142 --> 00:04:38.946
Today morning, 
I had to go to the hospital in an emergency.

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:42.333
I feel a bit better now.
I was there for 4-5 hours.

00:04:42.723 --> 00:04:44.399
I have no interest to continue in Oman.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.739
Let's see what can be done.

00:04:46.856 --> 00:04:49.507
Anyways, I had to leave 
without any treatment.

00:04:49.611 --> 00:04:51.697
Right now, I have taken some painkillers.

00:04:51.908 --> 00:04:54.600
This is the hospital, 
right in front of me.

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:57.047
The area is Ruwi.

00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:58.820
And why did I come here?

00:04:59.002 --> 00:05:01.821
I wanted to end my trip here.

00:05:01.893 --> 00:05:04.533
I am headed to the UAE to proceed further.

00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:07.067
I had planned to visit Europe 
after my Oman trip.

00:05:07.281 --> 00:05:08.796
Flights had already been booked.

00:05:08.932 --> 00:05:11.133
I had to fly from Dubai by Emirates.

00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:13.212
Emirates had already informed me, that,

00:05:13.323 --> 00:05:17.067
before boarding, I need to produce
the RTPCR test report.

00:05:17.163 --> 00:05:19.300
Without that 
you are not allowed to board the flight.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.433
But here, a different kind of problem
was waiting for me.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.567
This is the 
Badr Al Samaa Hospital of Ruwi.

00:05:25.681 --> 00:05:29.300
I had already arrived there
to take my RTPCR test.

00:05:29.828 --> 00:05:34.300
I was about to take the RTPCR test when
I came to know that Emirates

00:05:34.555 --> 00:05:38.233
accepts only those reports that have been 
tested in labs at Dubai.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.630
They accept the results 
from those labs alone.

00:05:40.719 --> 00:05:43.898
The only way out was to reach Dubai,
as soon as possible.

00:05:44.017 --> 00:05:48.003
Take the test there
and then board my flight.

00:05:48.153 --> 00:05:52.333
Less than 36 hours are left
for my flight to depart from Dubai.

00:05:53.276 --> 00:05:59.067
Now finally, from Ruwi, I'm going
to a place called Rusayl,

00:05:59.186 --> 00:06:01.967
from where I can get the long route buses.

00:06:02.763 --> 00:06:07.133
From Rusayl, 
I will board a shared taxi to Sohar.

00:06:07.411 --> 00:06:10.341
A very good friend of Mr. Farhat.

00:06:11.063 --> 00:06:14.100
will help me out 
to reach the border from Sohar.

00:06:14.561 --> 00:06:18.100
Mr. Farhat and his friend Mr. Gulam
are none less than angels to me.

00:06:18.335 --> 00:06:21.667
Mr. Gulam is 
a very good friend of Mr. Farhat.

00:06:21.838 --> 00:06:25.567
And so, he has happily agreed
to drop me at the border in his car.

00:06:26.279 --> 00:06:29.815
The way ahead,
that is the border between the two

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.900
has to be worked out by me.

00:06:32.069 --> 00:06:37.059
From there, I will be accompanied
by my good friend Mr. Taranjeet.

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:40.100
From Dubai to the border,
is a two-hour-long journey.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:42.270
The distances are all so complicated.

00:06:42.406 --> 00:06:47.096
I tried my level best
not to trouble people.

00:06:47.249 --> 00:06:49.822
I didn't want to bother them a lot.

00:06:49.957 --> 00:06:53.015
I am planning my way out
to create the least disturbances.

00:06:53.174 --> 00:06:57.700
But I am really grateful to all those
who stand by me to help me out.

00:06:58.472 --> 00:07:02.833
I also wanted to share the changing rules
due to the Covid pandemic.

00:07:03.295 --> 00:07:05.295
I was almost done 
with the RTPCR test here.

00:07:05.399 --> 00:07:07.600
The bus ticket was in my hand
and I had to cancel it.

00:07:08.904 --> 00:07:13.192
That report will not be accepted
and so I backed out from this place.

00:07:13.346 --> 00:07:15.147
Now, I have to take the test in Dubai.

00:07:15.266 --> 00:07:19.767
I do agree that the RTPCR test should be 
mandatory and it's a necessity too.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:24.067
It is equally important to protect 
Ourselves and protect our nation.

00:07:24.436 --> 00:07:26.223
It's good to know 
if we are infected or not.

00:07:26.327 --> 00:07:31.300
But, things are being made 
more and more complex.

00:07:31.658 --> 00:07:33.933
I am so exhausted.
I have a terrible headache.

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:37.500
Since morning, I am running here and there
without any proper food.

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:44.177
The time right now is 6.30 p.m.
I am sitting in a taxi.

00:07:45.324 --> 00:07:46.936
I am on the outskirts of Muscat.

00:07:47.119 --> 00:07:49.694
I am headed to Sohar.
It's a 2-hour journey from here.

00:07:49.917 --> 00:07:51.353
The fare is 4 Rial.

00:07:51.521 --> 00:07:54.300
Generally, it's about 5 Rial or so.

00:07:54.459 --> 00:07:56.741
You can negotiate to 4 Rials.

00:07:56.811 --> 00:08:01.033
But I had a terrible experience
at the taxi stand.

00:08:01.516 --> 00:08:04.309
The taxi drivers were pouncing on me.

00:08:04.413 --> 00:08:06.583
They were like, "Come to me, come to me."

00:08:06.829 --> 00:08:08.829
Thank God, they were not after my luggage.

00:08:09.968 --> 00:08:12.200
I am feeling somewhat hungry.

00:08:12.471 --> 00:08:14.153
I had nothing good since morning.

00:08:15.211 --> 00:08:17.443
The pain has started troubling me again.

00:08:18.367 --> 00:08:20.602
I'll take some food 
and then some medicine.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.700
Maybe, I'll feel better.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.860
It's 9 p.m. I'm a little ahead of Sohar.

00:08:28.249 --> 00:08:30.333
The reason for the halt was - food.

00:08:31.341 --> 00:08:34.700
Probably, 
this is my last Indian meal in Oman.

00:08:34.939 --> 00:08:38.533
Yeah, I said probably because,
I have yet to cross the border.

00:08:39.015 --> 00:08:42.432
I went to wash my hands and my face
and noticed the redness of my eyes.

00:08:42.503 --> 00:08:44.376
I am so exhausted.

00:08:44.609 --> 00:08:47.067
The whole journey was so tiring.

00:08:47.812 --> 00:08:52.667
But, the taste of Indian food
made me feel fresh again.

00:08:52.746 --> 00:08:53.808
I feel better.

00:08:53.888 --> 00:08:55.268
So, I have arrived at Sohar.

00:08:55.412 --> 00:08:57.800
The taxi dropped me 
at the crossing near Lulu.

00:08:57.907 --> 00:08:59.907
Lulu is the hypermarket
about which I was talking.

00:08:59.988 --> 00:09:02.422
They have quite a big chain here
and perhaps in the Gulf too.

00:09:02.723 --> 00:09:04.865
And there, I met Mr. Gulam.

00:09:05.091 --> 00:09:06.741
He is here, right in front of me.

00:09:06.833 --> 00:09:08.108
-Thanks a lot.
-Hi.

00:09:08.203 --> 00:09:10.120
Thank you very much
for bringing me here.

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:13.149
I have also thanked that gentleman,
because today...

00:09:13.364 --> 00:09:14.435
Yes, Please?

00:09:15.453 --> 00:09:17.575
-You belong to which place?
-I'm from Gujarat.

00:09:17.708 --> 00:09:18.790
Oh! You are from Gujarat.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.647
-Which place in Gujarat?
-Porbandar.

00:09:20.741 --> 00:09:23.533
-Porbandar? Did you come here long back?
-What?

00:09:23.576 --> 00:09:25.228
You are staying here for many years?

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:28.384
I came in 2003...

00:09:28.464 --> 00:09:31.833
I have my nephew here
and he called me back.

00:09:32.222 --> 00:09:35.400
The other gentleman opened the door
and quickly entered the video frame.

00:09:37.808 --> 00:09:40.451
I wanted to thank you 'on the camera'.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:45.202
I'm really grateful that you're driving me
to the border, it's almost 9 p.m now.

00:09:45.681 --> 00:09:50.715
Thank you so much and thanks to Mr. Farhat
for making this meet.

00:09:51.049 --> 00:09:53.900
It feels good 
to meet the Indian community in Oman.

00:09:56.621 --> 00:09:58.933
Today, it's 9th January 2022.

00:09:59.227 --> 00:10:02.633
I always upload my videos on Sundays.
But, this Sunday, I couldn't.

00:10:03.525 --> 00:10:06.400
There are two reasons.
Firstly, I am journeying.

00:10:06.624 --> 00:10:08.733
It was a long journey.
I have to board three flights.

00:10:08.887 --> 00:10:11.800
But now, that has again been extended,
as one flight stands canceled.

00:10:11.905 --> 00:10:16.300
Now, in such cases, the travel insurance
again comes to the picture.

00:10:16.554 --> 00:10:21.167
In case of any cancellations,
or any such unexpected issues,

00:10:21.265 --> 00:10:23.974
the travel insurance covers the risk.

00:10:24.205 --> 00:10:27.700
My insurance company, Tata AIG
was also covering this insurance.

00:10:27.869 --> 00:10:29.569
But again, the same issue.

00:10:29.633 --> 00:10:35.067
I wanted to share this experience as well,
so I am shooting this in this video.

00:10:35.735 --> 00:10:38.640
Two days before I started this journey,

00:10:38.704 --> 00:10:40.691
I received a mail informing me that
my second flight, the middle one...

00:10:40.778 --> 00:10:43.900
I had booked 3 different PNRs
in 3 different airlines.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.967
I had made direct bookings from airlines,
and not booked through any agencies.

00:10:48.048 --> 00:10:52.200
Please do take care of this thing, I had 
shared this information in another video.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:56.350
The flights are quite uncertain these days
because of Covid.

00:10:56.427 --> 00:10:59.464
Some are canceled, some re-scheduled.
some are delayed as well.

00:10:59.533 --> 00:11:02.766
Rules keep on changing now and then.

00:11:02.906 --> 00:11:04.651
This creates lots of problems for people.

00:11:04.901 --> 00:11:09.233
So, if you book through a third party,
like Yatra, Make my Trip, etc,

00:11:09.819 --> 00:11:12.808
then what happens is,

00:11:12.869 --> 00:11:16.515
airlines make their own deductions,
and these agencies go a step further.

00:11:16.578 --> 00:11:18.561
If booked directly, at least,
that (3rd Party share) money would be saved.

00:11:18.794 --> 00:11:21.500
Nowadays... I have mentioned this
in my earlier videos also,

00:11:21.583 --> 00:11:25.433
that these third parties 
create a lot of other issues.

00:11:25.557 --> 00:11:28.000
These are also known as OTAs.

00:11:28.146 --> 00:11:29.384
They trouble you a lot.

00:11:29.768 --> 00:11:32.400
To avoid being harassed by them,

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.700
to avoid a lot of other issues...

00:11:35.018 --> 00:11:38.609
Since March 2020 or say,
since the onset of Covid,

00:11:38.686 --> 00:11:41.400
I always book my tickets 
directly from the airline websites.

00:11:41.446 --> 00:11:42.978
This time also, I did the same.

00:11:43.067 --> 00:11:44.821
There were three different PNRs, but,

00:11:45.076 --> 00:11:47.233
my middle flight got canceled.

00:11:48.161 --> 00:11:52.033
They informed me in the mail
that they would re-schedule

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.767
and make a fresh ticket
and I need not do anything.

00:11:55.127 --> 00:11:59.667
The re-scheduled flight deferred 
from the previous one by 6-7 hours.

00:12:00.086 --> 00:12:04.633
Because of this new re-scheduled flight,
the last flight of my journey,

00:12:04.724 --> 00:12:06.526
was going to get missed.

00:12:06.773 --> 00:12:09.667
I called my travel insurance,
and the same scene again.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.572
It was again the third party.

00:12:11.707 --> 00:12:14.300
I wanted to explain that

00:12:14.607 --> 00:12:17.403
I received a mail 
two days prior to my departure,

00:12:17.484 --> 00:12:18.803
about re-schedule of my second flight

00:12:18.867 --> 00:12:20.867
and that ultimately 
the third flight was going to be missed.

00:12:21.012 --> 00:12:25.700
And if I cancel the third one, the new 
ticket was going to be more expensive.

00:12:26.758 --> 00:12:29.433
I wanted to ask, whether I should
book the flight now itself,

00:12:29.617 --> 00:12:31.729
or wait for some more time.

00:12:31.824 --> 00:12:35.374
That's because re-scheduling 
is so common these days.

00:12:35.918 --> 00:12:38.688
I was coming from Europe,

00:12:38.775 --> 00:12:41.533
and because of the rise in Covid cases,

00:12:41.644 --> 00:12:43.143
I am facing a lot of issues.

00:12:43.375 --> 00:12:45.235
Flights are being re-scheduled frequently.

00:12:46.268 --> 00:12:48.198
Rules and regulations keep on changing.

00:12:48.381 --> 00:12:52.533
Airports get crowded all of a sudden,
because of sudden changes in the rules.

00:12:52.889 --> 00:12:55.133
So, I also said that,

00:12:55.341 --> 00:12:57.735
if I buy the ticket,

00:12:58.266 --> 00:13:01.189
and if there's any change again,

00:13:01.261 --> 00:13:02.673
because 3 flights are involved here,

00:13:02.809 --> 00:13:06.067
so, should I wait for the second flight
to reach its destination.

00:13:06.171 --> 00:13:07.957
And after I reach the second destination,

00:13:08.045 --> 00:13:11.800
I can book the third one at the airport,
though it would cost me more.

00:13:11.924 --> 00:13:16.967
But I will be benefited,
like if there's any further change...

00:13:17.167 --> 00:13:20.833
Before taking any further steps,

00:13:21.012 --> 00:13:24.700
I wanted to share this 
with my insurance company

00:13:24.802 --> 00:13:28.000
and act according to the advice
given by the company.

00:13:29.628 --> 00:13:31.933
"Send the documents, we'll look further."

00:13:32.495 --> 00:13:35.167
This was their stereotype reply.

00:13:35.265 --> 00:13:36.257
The same issue again.

00:13:36.337 --> 00:13:40.367
The call dropped a number of times.
Calls got disconnected a lot of times.

00:13:40.866 --> 00:13:43.174
Tata AIG, I request you
to kindly look into the matter.

00:13:43.338 --> 00:13:47.733
I faced this issue 
in the first week of December, in Oman.

00:13:48.088 --> 00:13:51.000
And again in Europe.

00:13:51.083 --> 00:13:53.258
And this is January 2022.

00:13:53.388 --> 00:13:55.443
The situation is the same.
There are absolutely no changes.

00:13:55.645 --> 00:13:58.033
I have shared my experience with Tata AIG,

00:13:58.115 --> 00:14:00.800
and have put all the facts 
in a transparent manner.

00:14:01.198 --> 00:14:05.700
But, Please... Because I would 
need travel insurance in the near future,

00:14:05.893 --> 00:14:07.409
even you may need the same.

00:14:07.513 --> 00:14:10.033
Please feel free to share your travel 
experience with other companies,

00:14:10.904 --> 00:14:13.733
if you have claimed at any point in time.

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.472
Please, do share the same.

00:14:15.817 --> 00:14:18.900
There's a Facebook group 
of tourist helpline where you can share.

00:14:19.042 --> 00:14:20.506
You can even share 
in the comments section.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.570
That would help other people too.

